# Part directories are SEPARATE git repositories living inside this workspace
# (T14): the workspace repo carries the manifest, the shared brief record and
# the orchestration scripts — never the parts' history. Every dir listed in
# workspace.json parts[].dir must appear here as /<dir>/; regeneration rewrites
# workspace.json and this block together, and `pnpm ws:verify` fails when they
# fall out of step.
